SUMMARY:No Other Choice
DTSTART:20260216T034500Z
DTEND:20260216T062000Z
DTSTAMP:20260216T034500Z
UID:XZ1ahmSm4j
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 139 mins (2h19m)\n\nIn his diabolical new thriller\,
  Park Chan-wook crafts a dark fable about the cutthroat nature of contempo
 rary work culture\, starring Lee Byung Hun as a husband and father who tak
 es violent action after being laid off. Nominated for three Golden Globes
  including Best Motion Picture - Musical or Comedy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/cinema/in-theaters/no-other-choice\n\nEstimated start: 20:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
