BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Safe (1995)
DTSTART:20260217T030000Z
DTEND:20260217T052000Z
DTSTAMP:20260217T030000Z
UID:pNHaU63YYO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 123 mins (2h03m)\n\nJulianne Moore gives an astonish
 ing performance as Carol White\, a suburban housewife whose affluent envir
 onment suddenly turns against her.  A bold\, darkly comic\, completely or
 iginal drama\, depicting Carol's descent into the horrors of modern-day li
 ving from acclaimed filmmaker Todd Haynes (Poison\, Superstar). New 4K re
 storation.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/safe\n\nEstimated st
 art: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
